[00:00.00] 作曲 : Joybeth Taylor/Helene Cronin
[00:00.00][by:stillworkingonit]
[00:17.44] I used to kneel beside my bed at night when I was small
[00:17.44]年幼时 我常在深夜跪在床边祈祷
[00:23.60] It was easy as breathing, believing wasn't hard at all
[00:23.60]那时的信仰 像呼吸一般自然 毫无半分犹疑
[00:31.01] I knew that you were there close as my next prayer
[00:31.01]深知你就在近旁 随着下一声祷告便能触及
[00:38.03] The world I'll break you down, break your heart
[00:38.03]这尘世会让人遍体鳞伤 令人心碎神伤
[00:41.94] And shake your faith but now you feel so far away
[00:41.94]更动摇了信仰 此时只觉你我之间山高水长
[00:47.99] I don't know who's to blame
[00:47.99]不知该归咎于谁
[00:51.20] I don't talk to you as much, maybe that's part of growing up
[00:51.20]我已许久不曾与你倾诉 也许这便是成长的代价
[00:57.51]
[00:58.75] I carry on this one way conversation
[00:58.75]我独自维系着这番单方面的独白
[01:05.47] I'm listening but You don't say a word
[01:05.47]屏息凝神地倾听 你却始终沉默不语
[01:11.94] If your answer's in the silence, I'll be patient
[01:11.94]若你的答复就藏在静默里 我会耐下性子等候
[01:19.07] But it's hard to know my prayers are being heard
[01:19.07]可要确定祈求已传达入耳 谈何容易
[01:26.08] I'm waiting on a whisper, just something to confirm that
[01:26.08]我在等一个微弱的耳语 只为印证那份牵绊
[01:32.44] You and me are still on speaking terms
[01:32.44]确信你我之间 依然还能有些许交集
[01:36.91]
[01:43.62] I mostly come around now when things aren't working out
[01:43.62]如今我总在诸事不顺时 才迟迟现身
[01:50.52] I show up with my questions, my stumbles, and my doubts
[01:50.52]带着满腹疑虑 那些跌撞与困惑不请自来
[01:57.16] Always thinking of myself, and always asking you for help
[01:57.16]一心只顾着自己 总是向你寻求援手
